WEBVTT

00:06:29.326 --> 00:06:31.566
that will take care of our offspring.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.483
For our children,

00:06:33.507 --> 00:06:35.418
and our children's children,

00:06:35.442 --> 00:06:36.695
and all those yet to come,

00:06:36.719 --> 00:06:40.164
we must fall in love
with rivers and mountains,

00:06:40.188 --> 00:06:42.491
with ice sheets and savannas,

00:06:42.515 --> 00:06:46.550
and reconnect with the long
and life-giving cycles of nature.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.486
Let us all become time rebels

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.375
and be inspired by
the beautiful Mohawk blessing

00:06:52.399 --> 00:06:55.031
spoken when a child is born:

00:06:55.055 --> 00:06:56.826
"Thank you, Earth.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.427
You know the way."